{"job_id":"F-2859e3118af679144400","family_id":"F-2859e3118af679144400","title":"외무공무원 자격심사에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":17,"target_id":"7c086b84b9a245b48ef9ba9da8dc3d07353a25b18499dbd17a6fee433b64c2dc","source_hash":"a5e24417506dc1fcd00ad89f6917c2b748093c81349dc80d530240829d818590","text":"外交官资格考试规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":141,"target_id":"c1a688a9fd6810ec76872604524f2411108837eb8bb4812757738ab32e3ee20f","source_hash":"cbfc39eaa7e18fa1d54e15599d8ffdb93899a07d2f36a987d4a83748d158dc0f","text":"第一条（目的）本规则旨在规定外交官根据《外交官任命条例》第十八条的规定，在首次被任命为参赞及以上职级或高级公务员之前，必须参加资格考试的必要事项。<2007年11月22日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":141,"end":309,"target_id":"5484510b4203bb6f15363a6c0fda272356b47bd8379b33e20fe31e57e72103fa","source_hash":"ce7b85eaba9bd2c88e2f9741c68c50f2297e354ed75884ea33dc2053ff6a4e1c","text":"第二条（资格考试的分类）  外交官资格考试（以下简称“资格考试”）分为初任参赞级职位前的资格考试（以下简称“参赞级资格考试”）和初任高级公务员职位前的资格考试（以下简称“高级外交官资格考试”）。<2007年11月22日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":309,"end":508,"target_id":"3f70252fea6b3a0db6fb61ec2af7cc89b95e1b4d8630cdb4bf60f6a201b9ea1d","source_hash":"d39742af316fb66e74c63726d0feef1a61b8aa385f2faa7c9a604c9f33174102","text":"第三条（资格考试的实施和公布）\n①原则上，资格审查每年进行两次，分为上半年和下半年，除非有特殊情况。\n② 外交部长拟依第一款规定举行资格考试时，应当以书面文件（包括电子文件）公布资格考试日期、报考要求及其他有关考试实施的事项。<2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":508,"end":1612,"target_id":"4818b136f582d89d9d31e9227ad50fdc898c229d641232c3a6a2ba0fc769d32d","source_hash":"212cda89ea4820be01a0ff201f408597292ed565879e5e2bf34f0cfa2a7b21d2","text":"第四条（资格考试申请）\n① 拟参加资格考试的外交官应当向外交部长提出申请，申请条件如下：<2007年11月22日、2013年3月23日、2015年10月20日修订>\n1. 顾问级资格考试：凡根据《外交官任命条例》（以下简称“条例”）第22条规定参加外语能力考试（包括由外交部长确定的首尔大学英语能力考试（以下简称“首尔大学英语能力考试”））并取得下列任何一项成绩，且符合条例第18条之6第1款任何一项规定的人员，均可参加外语能力考试。但是，如果一名外交官在任命时其职位系列为外交信息技术系列，且其英语外语能力测试成绩达到 50 分或以上，或第二外语外语能力测试成绩达到 60 分或以上，则应视为其已满足有关外语能力测试成绩的申请要求。\na. 英语 60 分或以上\nB. 英语成绩达到50分或以上，且第二外语成绩达到60分或以上\n2. 高级外交官资格考试：英语或第二外语外语水平考试成绩达到60分以上，且符合实施法令第18-2条任何一项规定的人员。\n② 以相关资格考试公布日期前推算的第十周年纪念日所在年份的1月1日或之后取得的最高外语水平成绩为准。<2015年10月20日修订>\n③ 尽管有第2款的规定，但若资格审查候选人因在海外外交机构任职或从海外外交机构返回总部不足一年等原因，在资格审查公布之日起倒数第十周年的当年1月1日之后未取得外语能力考试成绩，则该候选人可以申请，但须在返回韩国后一年内提交外语能力考试成绩。在此情况下，若未在返回韩国后一年内提交外语能力考试成绩，则视为从未提出申请。<2007年11月22日、2011年12月28日、2012年3月19日、2015年10月20日修订>\n4. 根据第1款申请参加资格考试的外交官，可以在根据第6条进行能力评估之前撤回该考试申请。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1612,"end":1732,"target_id":"e3d7423de94182f4143a529d7b1e8f5042b2dd1f801b9eafe37542648509f155","source_hash":"7f6ce91f95e49f87efe93d1e19ae6045503dcba5612940b6b16e71e6c21273c0","text":"第五条（资格考试候选人的遴选）  外交部长应当根据第四条规定申请参加资格考试者的服役经历等情况遴选资格考试候选人，并以书面形式（包括电子文件）予以公布。<2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1732,"end":2007,"target_id":"addf407120d667eb751de355f010ce189256d19f57be00d668265d2fcc3775eb","source_hash":"1827f75827ce58c5f14d695e26d6d1fd961a452588bd5796056751f4f4835e73","text":"第六条（资格考试人员的教育）\n① 根据第五条选拔的参谋级资格审查候选人，应当接受培训以培养参谋级外交能力（以下简称“参谋级外交能力发展培训”）。\n② 根据第五条选拔的高级外交官候选人，应当接受培养高级外交能力的教育（以下简称“高级外交官候选人教育”）。\n③ 关于第一款和第二款所述教育的具体内容、实施时间、完成标准等必要事项，由外交部长决定。<2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2007,"end":2604,"target_id":"68a9a9bec0f70f24d188d461dec0c08158ede61f4af085f75bf59a6ebfb5cde5","source_hash":"7104d9398ef2d62e80d49094818d3a3c204be91e98264b47bd47ca0542cfb24b","text":"第七条（参赞级外交能力和高级外交能力的评估）\n① 外交部长应当依据《实施令》第18条之6款，对已完成参谋长级外交能力发展培训并须接受资格审查的人员进行参谋长级外交能力评估。但是，在申请资格审查前已通过参谋长级外交能力评估的人员，可免于再次接受评估。<2007年11月22日修订；2013年3月23日修订>\n② 外交部长应当依据《实施令》第18条之4款，对已完成高级外交官培训并接受高级外交官资格审查的人员进行高级外交能力评估。<2007年11月22日新增；2013年3月23日修订>\n③ 除资格审查目的外，不得对外披露候选人外交能力评估结果。<2007年11月22日修订，2011年12月28日修订>\n4. 外交部长可将第1款和第2款规定的外交能力评估工作委托给韩国国立外交学院院长。<2007年11月22日、2012年3月19日、2013年3月23日修订>\n⑤ 根据第1款和第2款进行外交能力评估所需的评估要素、评估方法及其他事项，由外交部长确定。<2007年11月22日修订；2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2604,"end":3032,"target_id":"669400cf0c3d5abb6745ecd19bde1d5937979b822e92aec3786315bbe5690104","source_hash":"970047e5571aafa0d350c4975dd6b645a71305aa2c6c4a76bc244376f69a4ecc","text":"第八条（参谋级官员等资格考试标准）\n① 外事官员资格考试委员会（以下简称“委员会”）依据《外事官员法》第十三条之二第二款，对依据第七条第一款通过参赞级外交能力考核的人员，应首先按照附表所列标准，以学历培训成果、人事考核结果及纪律处分记录为考核因素，确定其是否具备资格。<2007年11月22日修订>\n② 对于已根据第1款获得初步资格认定的候选人，委员会应综合评估其工作表现、工作经验、工作能力和态度、所获奖励和荣誉以及纪律情况，对辅导员级别资格审查的候选人资格作出最终认定。<2007年11月22日修订>\n③ 删除 <2007.11.22>\n4. 如有必要对辅导员级别的资格进行审查，委员会可要求候选人到委员会作证或提交书面陈述。<2007年11月22日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3032,"end":3191,"target_id":"eca5498bced72c804bf3080fba21b0d387827e8fb3ea7d398043593ffe87644a","source_hash":"dfa7cd6b4b9b77ec5da9616473d972bd3d5f22ce6524e0eafc4085c4bc59285b","text":"第八条之二（高级外交官等资格考试标准）\n① 委员会应当认定，根据第七条第二款通过高级外交能力评估的人员具备资格。\n② 委员会可要求高级外交官资格考试的考生到委员会面前作证或以书面形式作证。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3191,"end":3299,"target_id":"b734001354499a5e2e3a8d77495c7c9002d6bfe74c79b7f689cc7c3a6ffff3b3","source_hash":"a63b310d8bc5c17d1ab45188c7973adfe7c658189839af02e7111159223c98ba","text":"第九条（针对不符合资格人员的措施）  经资格审查认定为不符合资格的人员，不得申请参加下一期资格审查。但是，因未通过能力评估而被认定为不符合资格的人员，不受此限制。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3299,"end":3320,"target_id":"35f9913ba82cc589522c1b67f8f7bf86230706ddaa16fdbe8c9607152dc7fb03","source_hash":"552a6b7059950bc91276fe7ae054fb6184eb5f2397feaae55f1f9bfe335e2c8b","text":"补充规定 <第71号，2006年12月6日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3320,"end":3351,"target_id":"1700448a02e3c12962d5677467c3d3210945f284e4d8e9016a7f7f8da58ace1f","source_hash":"90858a9f0619781fd12c847a12960234f781a731d8df4c39550910624927ded0","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3351,"end":3614,"target_id":"abba3d348545aff45cbc9c5f295915ec2fa0cfca66436a3042a783fd15097e95","source_hash":"e55c195af55dc45dd6317b67657ab6a57f7ca6375ec475ccc99ab3a7df8a05db","text":"第二条（关于资格考试申请要求的过渡措施）尽管有第四条的规定，但任命时职级为外交领事职级（指原外交行政职级）的外交官，如在2007年12月31日之前举行的外交信息技术职级（指原外交信息管理职级）外交官资格考试中，英语达到5级或某一专业外语达到4级及以上，则视为符合外语能力等级的申请要求；如在2008年12月31日之前举行的外交信息技术职级（指原外交信息管理职级）外交官资格考试中，英语达到5级或某一专业外语达到4级及以上，则视为符合外语能力等级的申请要求。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3614,"end":3826,"target_id":"f53fb5e4602037c4a57057fbee5bac7ca3d5b484df7e403fdca30b8d02fd08c8","source_hash":"6927cd4b1f6bb11ad9fcc9ea931fe617a22e553799f92b13cfc50cde61a336a4","text":"第三条（关于考试标准适用的过渡措施）① 凡于2007年12月31日前完成外交贸易部长依据实施令第三十条第二款规定的教育课程的外交官，应视为符合第八条第一款及附件表格规定的教育培训成果资格标准。<2007年11月22日修订>\n\n  ② 根据第8条进行资格审查时，应当反映2005年1月1日或之后进行的人员评估结果。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3826,"end":3997,"target_id":"f603208d559d4b049df14dfdf5778db97e074c5b4865c3f6833d63ba3c174a5a","source_hash":"6b045a80d230569267b914b4bef36c96af6f5516c10c1ba51ab9db26bd65a3f3","text":"第四条（资格考试的特别规定）在本规则实施时，根据《公务员薪酬条例》第五十一条规定担任外交官职级七级或八级职务的人员，视为已通过参赞级资格考试；根据本规则规定担任外交官职级九级及以上职务的人员，视为已通过部长级资格考试。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3997,"end":4044,"target_id":"6425fbd4511072491d34ccdb55af0b01f6f4aae895c78a563b0286e559c8ae4e","source_hash":"28d7e82b4731e1641de55b56eb213da58842356121709cb7a3f04007da683029","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）《外事官员任命条例》实施细则部分修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4044,"end":4068,"target_id":"96b2a634693893359c86e466c2bab31136c7c20e27268693a0bd6f8458d1baf9","source_hash":"0042156c854f20ef3baaaa134f3dcc5cb9aa6c64deec9b262972b30f42f20fe2","text":"  兹删除第6条及附录6。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4068,"end":4090,"target_id":"234b116dccc941759ad707cdcfac409d43614ec208a040bd341811b7f5c45314","source_hash":"82608995f8256be01c307ddbc2b3b10d0fbf8a5e001f45ca705339725ca63552","text":"补充规定 <2007年11月22日第79号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4090,"end":4121,"target_id":"7f5a1b5848ea162273c38f5cf821d1b57a63de520eaad7a515fdfe17ef861420","source_hash":"90858a9f0619781fd12c847a12960234f781a731d8df4c39550910624927ded0","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4121,"end":4304,"target_id":"acd858b5f01e1d36a1f720a9d6b396c7193b584194e87cb11504a471e6ed711b","source_hash":"9de9fa5b2da8fb93e39c0c58af09028d228324bb9ed3b1e2e78e9cc22c785f4b","text":"第二条（关于参谋级职位资格考试人员教育的过渡措施）  凡在本规则生效前，已完成外交与国家安全研究所为现任职于五级和六级职位的人员举办的、旨在培养参谋级职位所需能力的教育课程（依据实施令第三十条第二款规定）的人员，应视为已完成依据第六条第一款规定进行的参谋级职位外交能力发展教育。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4304,"end":4407,"target_id":"8375780af83511d7760360daf5d344514ddc5e932ce058a9d4943a09c8ad823a","source_hash":"c5109c36f3ca629f7a5f9233f36b180b391023f225e44a148d1c793f3ed3e0b3","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①《关于支付额外海外津贴的规定》部分修改如下。\n\n  在第 2 条至第 6 条以及附件 1 中，“特殊外语”应改为“第二外语”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4407,"end":4595,"target_id":"a08d6ff700cd0fd7eb2ddc162636aa199a447b26e96c442e2b274ce4ff51f30e","source_hash":"b8e8c3e9f93d5bbd07873b787b50fad13c7626c0f9f4462b4a4f294333004ead","text":"  第 3 条中的“五年”应改为“十年”，“五年期满后”应改为“十年期满后”。\n\n  ② 《外交官晋升规则》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第五条第一款第二项中，“特殊外语等级”应改为“第二外语等级”，“特殊外语等级”应改为“第二外语等级”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4595,"end":4639,"target_id":"0d90beb671bc0ef6030953ac86a5bfa7309f1d5d893c1d79781e83f7a603226e","source_hash":"04f6125376bb8c8ce900eca619a253b27e64644eb9ea86b883d1aaf8d2f02f8f","text":"补充规定 <第125号，2011年12月28日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4639,"end":4700,"target_id":"e38f840f143c9537c9cb0349efc8605498f984a9d107389e62e1e8c020f46777","source_hash":"8b4255ed2f2f99013f5f484172e3c38e87dbde629ce3585a38952defdb481490","text":"增补（关于韩国国立外交学院成立后，对外交官晋升规则等作出部分修订）<2012年3月19日第131号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4700,"end":4730,"target_id":"c95c0c83cebaf8cce9ce3014f12017f2c69422125a27c717bac2669534188a81","source_hash":"0d63a18201aaf2f1d98d1a1c71f36ac02913f4fc2004246a24afe6bdd25c6c45","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4730,"end":4815,"target_id":"5a82ba1671dc07c812e3fbb3f850eeb04658b50c17b1ed224e37c0fa210562f2","source_hash":"e6d3df95b4968e40554bb65ae2af965e3d3f3013862454d1046ffb0f461b6ad0","text":"第二条（关于外语成绩评定的过渡措施）本法令生效时，由外交安全研究院评定的外语成绩，应视为由韩国国立外交学院评定的外语成绩。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4815,"end":4856,"target_id":"c2f2b92c50d1867de2b20513b4ba5eb94a785792baea61cb4f26d6300056a97f","source_hash":"378c099c8259e3ca325c93a2ac77ea1eb2d32724a739a011ae42921644f383a4","text":"补充规定（外交部及其下属机构组织结构实施细则）<2013年3月23日第1号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4856,"end":4902,"target_id":"9b1acc8f0743397f79d003882b21eb4ec54cbda65fe56ca880c357c8b7302519","source_hash":"ce3145e93bda203ec3e87e7bc25e691f9b574a33d33d742afdfdccffb408a741","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4902,"end":5088,"target_id":"ab12ec37636e0fe26cc4a64b042c11aca76c9a0ba97632aa4edc3d8913e4cfc0","source_hash":"10c321fc7ec54196c5009ff8c56f07c9eb6212f345e0ffd9b5ebc653953c9f29","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至⑨ 省略\n\n  10. 对外交官资格考试规则部分修改如下。\n\n  在第3条第2款；第4条第1款的各分款以外的部分；第5条；第6条第3款；以及第7条第1款和该条第2款、第4款、第5款的正文中，“外交和贸易部长”应改为“外交部长”。\n\n  ⑪ 至 <18> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5088,"end":6833,"target_id":"99156f3935f1ffea96a802254a132b3b86f387fa5f25055fcd9065c47dcbfc3b","source_hash":"5422d4d0c575d1700c12caaae2ccdbeef7c80ccc389aa22828a283c0de4802d6","text":"补充规定 <第30号，2015年10月20日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n确定咨询师级别资格筛选第一阶段资格的标准（与第8条第1款相关）\n[附件] <修订于 2015.10.20.>                                                         \n\n  确定辅导员级别资格筛选第一轮资格的标准（与第8条第1款相关）                            \n\n  1. 教育和培训结果的资格标准                                                       \n\n    A. 自参赞级别资格审查候选人被任命为外交官的次年起，资格审查即告生效。         \n\n  截至审查前一年的平均培训时长为下表所示的年度标准时长。             \n\n  计算的相关年度完成的总培训小时数的平均值等于或大于               \n\n  执行。                                                                             \n\n┌───────────────────────────┬────────────┐\n\n│类别│总计│\n\n├───────────────────────────┼────────────┤\n\n│·연중 교육면제기간 또는 재외공관근무기간이 통산하여 1│70시간                  │\n\n│如果月份或更短│ │\n\n├───────────────────────────┼────────────┤\n\n│·年度教育豁免期或海外外交服务期累计1年│ │\n\n│如果超过6个月但不超过6个月│ │\n\n│  1) 1개월 초과 ～ 2개월 이하                         │60시간                  │\n\n│  2) 2개월 초과 ～ 4개월 이하                         │50시간                  │\n\n│ 3) 超过 4 个月 ~ 6 个月或更短 │40 小时 │\n\n├───────────────────────────┼────────────┤\n\n│·如果在海外外交使团的年度服务期超过6个月│30小时│\n\n├───────────────────────────┼────────────┤\n\n│·如果年度教育豁免期超过6个月│豁免│\n\n└───────────────────────────┴────────────┘\n\n    ※ 备注                                                                         \n\n    对于在下半年接受辅导员级别资格审查的候选人，已在相关年度上半年完成  的候选人，          \n\n  平均训练时长可以通过将所有训练时长相加来计算。               \n\n    B. 在A款中，“教育豁免期”是指下列任何时期         \n\n"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00001","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605700","source_hash":"900bf61317f308fd7ee692084fe2f3eab93d6a9424bea88f252bd9e75e16d9df","text":"[附录] <修订于 2015.10.20.>"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00002","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605701","source_hash":"1d02fa39b417b72e6ccbbbff9e0938b87231a4b0fa6cf53bb16ae8b816002504","text":"确定辅导员级别资格筛选第一轮资格的标准（与第8条第1款相关）"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00003","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605702","source_hash":"b6cdedbeb29b589a2abb836d8aa8074594940e88f03dcdb22d89ca0ad9a854f3","text":"1. 教育和培训结果的资格标准"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00004","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605703","source_hash":"c462152e1df54b77d6e4438bbca8ae2e28bac82b34ab206e2e4fc6ef4637facb","text":"a. 自参赞级别资格审查候选人被任命为外交官的次年起，资格审查即告终止。"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00005","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605704","source_hash":"408f7ebbfa63a20d58d04ca4a2b4ecd95b87fc715308e11a493fe195677c24a7","text":"下表列出了截至上一年度评估时已完成的平均教育和培训时长，即年度标准时长。"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00006","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605705","source_hash":"e58e18ee4dedae90ef33f1a36b3e780f32c7cf7d7ded33b3ee8e55cfefa7ba89","text":"计算的相关年度完成的总培训小时数的平均值等于或大于"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00007","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605706","source_hash":"b07f284c168b4439d8094be830d84b516e0148679cabd0662c895cfc05d593ad","text":"."},{"id":"A35754-zh-00008","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605707","source_hash":"d8ba487317ac4e370c544ff11fee92077c5dfe235d14d8d93e213e278685f7be","text":"分类MTQ29f13724665d54a300119结束"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00009","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605708","source_hash":"149df7a8bd3e6659b07cf3d93118f27be2585ec4639af3aecfcfe90303b3ccf7","text":"总计"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00010","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605709","source_hash":"24ceb2aad9d37282a04a173d63d4aca01f7d1895d3a2aab02e2120083621184d","text":"·年度教育豁免期或在海外外交使团的服务期累计为 1"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00011","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605710","source_hash":"9cb5a70d6a0940403e25be7c86d9895fbfa83027ee989eb1d4c7a02a371deb8f","text":"70时间"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00012","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605711","source_hash":"e6859eb9a815648e3eadd823a5ee3ecd93685b67eacc23a5fd59d55d290b81be","text":"如果月份或更短"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00013","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605712","source_hash":"24ceb2aad9d37282a04a173d63d4aca01f7d1895d3a2aab02e2120083621184d","text":"·年度教育豁免期或在海外外交使团的服务期累计为 1"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00014","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605713","source_hash":"5ae141286c6ba050c684e118c0f793498695a02d91fbdc47f845f03ba0cb5beb","text":"如果超过 6 个月但不足 6 个月，则"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00015","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605714","source_hash":"320dab80636588a021963e81158dd990fcc301f3823fd614da69b0e8e3c1b3b8","text":"1) 超过 1 个月 ~ 2 个月或更短"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00016","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605715","source_hash":"50493760d84c2d00dfa57c28801ecd4517014eec33fcaeaabdb9dbb9e68785ff","text":"60小时"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00017","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605716","source_hash":"6d7d6d0a602f55e821c9cc96f1ed77044fa647aaeddfa44eea2c4d256c3e5230","text":"2) 超过 2 个月 ~ 4 个月或更短"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00018","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605717","source_hash":"afe7d1f528e0b4b75982eec9a77cecbea4aeec3ccfddd91f5f0ef2cc79b3da00","text":"50小时"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00019","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605718","source_hash":"041510625d1715fb327aa0ed0ec6fa43cf8f9ac9d48cb6cbd71ae9a1dfe4c6ee","text":"3) 超过 4 个月 ~ 6 个月或更短"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00020","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605719","source_hash":"a13abd4192bcf52d4002a32054bd15480a5e2a6a8786a8cad714a8daa4b2f8fb","text":"40 小时"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00021","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605720","source_hash":"e3d66ce5c1777f5a93a8d7ff29ef4f92158795bc220ac4dc8f65277f58836506","text":"·如果在海外外交使团的年度服务期超过6个月"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00022","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605721","source_hash":"5b44f4f5841d4a341de02c2933b1dd6269d1065431a4fd42fda75e3b4f835922","text":"30时间"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00023","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605722","source_hash":"a909df86bf5a1cfff8c928a859aa1b455f2ce9b738a5f6641291db1b68faa173","text":"·如果年度教育豁免期超过6个月"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00024","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605723","source_hash":"67f25a658eb0af6958245bab402e24e1c4996e2f45cd337fa5b7dba5df0ba83e","text":"豁免"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00025","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605724","source_hash":"a0be5b33dabffdfd85854fdd198a945de10f8238e6c078b287660dc43c44fcd4","text":"※ 备注"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00026","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605725","source_hash":"2ba799b7a022165b36c63a0e81ebf60670c27d8381ba12cdeb5fc6c471a66f67","text":"对于在下半年接受参赞级官员资格审查的候选人，那些在相关年份上半年完成所有要求的候选人，将获得资格审查。"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00027","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605726","source_hash":"55ee36afca6d9803e374386f31f1a64eb62b481d65ec9596f30ae56c70785957","text":"平均训练时间可以通过将所有训练小时数加起来计算得出。"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00028","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605727","source_hash":"cb9dd5d8487b9df016fe3707afc314dcfda4fb25f707668de7fc7144ab23af03","text":"b. 在第a款中，“教育豁免期”是指以下任何时期"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00029","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605728","source_hash":"581d7432d17a8bb1a9126a9b9d558f65ecda93a65fd3e5b340d55d650b003147","text":"."},{"id":"A35754-zh-00030","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605729","source_hash":"56e0a527fbbbfa9ee845c9fd7c7818ae3ea852f13d9667c4bdfae3ca5ddfbd07","text":"根据《国家公务员法》第32条之4第1款，行政支持、培训和其他能力发展"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00031","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605730","source_hash":"4d7ace71e2fcd76819f5112620c5a87bd99331f51a71d344cfa6993437feb46e","text":"为其他国家机关、公共组织、政府投资机构、国内外教育机构等之目的。"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00032","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605731","source_hash":"7d204683c22014609f31110a6afc56f9c78d092d56cd0228c40b3b60db13442b","text":"向研究机构或其他机构派遣的期限"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00033","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605732","source_hash":"ea8bbc5ed9224214cda1b1c0f5524e84242fb5b7d9907d6381588e69e3b07e1e","text":"2) 根据《国家公职人员法》第71条规定的休假期限"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00034","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605733","source_hash":"79d174c2673a0aee44abb106afcec24f9ebf4098088cc4cd0d26f656a3d92ad6","text":"此外，如果外交官资格考试委员会认定有必要豁免教育和培训，则"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00035","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605734","source_hash":"504ab257d5e035eca273a243ca3e45479a9dcfa0b4a98c820e5578fb00a3c04d","text":"固定周期"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00036","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605735","source_hash":"8c48f8c46a45290ede6be789798988d656ad4cef8d5ac436a0fbb6722101ac45","text":"2. 绩效考核结果资格标准"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00037","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605736","source_hash":"b565846b6338d83832dce6f2b7c210bb325ec41112a0a76288e4142d303ea986","text":"a. 根据实施法令第31条，自资格审查之日起7年内，接受咨询师级别资格审查的人员"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00038","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605737","source_hash":"dfcf7de8507fbcbd579a673adde226e80de9d8b2f154a2fd59b30fd7856f87d3","text":"] ["},{"id":"A35754-zh-00039","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605738","source_hash":"eeede427f948903ddc55a34234e2c804de34ab65b668121d82b354064eaae314","text":"合格。"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00040","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605739","source_hash":"6bac72fc340817f67c611edcb257418adab4bc1d7944ad7bdb710b1d38686147","text":"B. 在应用项目 A 的标准时，应遵循以下方法。"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00041","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605740","source_hash":"12aa1fa0c9ad5c8675eeccd237b81ce391d84fce3dcb485f98e20b5fb07cd681","text":"1) 应用绩效评估结果时，如果被评估人员的职位系列有分类，则"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00042","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605741","source_hash":"15284abcb062a087c0b72662c2373baaa556a6461aa896d87a40eeaa543ea538","text":"以上应用了按职级和职系划分的人员评价排名，以及人员评价对象"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00043","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605742","source_hash":"e4e4800cba925a8a36737e397839af88f52ee098d29553de9ad7469f33c8f9d6","text":"如果没有职位系列分类，则按职位等级进行人员评估排名。"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00044","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605743","source_hash":"6463f070753c72d9bde2d9bc88b284bb79d5e5a5a76c6d23e5ed3f15f3866db7","text":"2) 即使你的绩效评估排名在后 5%，相关的绩效评估分数也是 90 分"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00045","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605744","source_hash":"386b30999b990c21caa4123e5c5f0e3cf3c8348c988505468c90f3ad771a9145","text":"或更高，则认为它不在后 5% 之列。"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00046","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605745","source_hash":"980f63705923ee83541974e47215a97acc2671975b68c772f4447fede8b1ae5b","text":"3) 即使绩效评估分数两次或两次以上处于后 5%，每个个人"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00047","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605746","source_hash":"61ccb25f1b0ae629fbeb78c0e7968e6c86b92a3fb27e081c21ed7957ca69d69b","text":"如果绩效评估中所有直接上级都是同一人，则视为一次人员评估。"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00048","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605747","source_hash":"01b5f1e118c1e8db655d19a87239facd13ec41f30f6b1b9acdda762bd9f41128","text":"查看."},{"id":"A35754-zh-00049","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605748","source_hash":"37661bb94f65bd87bfcec4fd41b4d2f8bd0e18b56d1b8a1dc330b9e0d08a6332","text":"4) 在第 (a) 款规定的辅导员级别资格审查期间，人员评估中的最高分"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00050","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605749","source_hash":"46cc323ba712de9f40b565d421735b054aaec1b790373f89172d2d4213ba6259","text":"如果曾获得过 START 评级，则其次数处于绩效评估的后 5%。"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00051","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605750","source_hash":"f7a38415284188a99f5c0e6f5531fd86e81779493e4171cb6a02c703839a5576","text":"从固定计数中扣除。"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00052","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605751","source_hash":"15441593097a6ac73e0f77983fd00a1cd710ef2e2b630c114a5ceabce55f8ad4","text":"3. 纪律处分资格标准"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00053","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605752","source_hash":"b1dcb6d60d8dde822a9de0ef1c8a8a575377cbad4166fb3133df46cd2bb6ecfb","text":"如果辅导员级别资格审查的候选人符合以下任何一项，则[该候选人][不合适]。"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00054","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605753","source_hash":"0781f7c41cc434396154cc3b61b6e4ad1bc6c9d124ebe13b8996b5b8c17e22d0","text":"."},{"id":"A35754-zh-00055","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605754","source_hash":"17b001b58ada0c7872e19123d2aa7fcf14426630e8c859fc7fc97d82617c33e1","text":"a. 在纪律处分请求或纪律处分决定请求待决的情况下"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00056","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605755","source_hash":"fa6f0ca82996442e5f7e8c0e0d48aa9bf2754d85b5bd7ab1f01388f3882c22d5","text":"B. 若受到纪律处分"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00057","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605756","source_hash":"1604e9a589a893be491896996914192fc7d3136fb9e78ac09f8fc7a9222bf6e7","text":"。自严重纪律处分执行完毕之日起 18 个月（接受金钱和招待、公共资金）。结束日期为"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00058","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605757","source_hash":"77c637b8d781e0928b9108b92b6cd8c2a2ca97ec1667c60e6cb3830d3783d791","text":"如果因贪污、挪用公款、性暴力、性骚扰和卖淫等严重违纪行为而受到纪律处分，则该房屋"},{"id":"A35754-zh-00059","doc":"A35754","law_id":"kr-010352-175696-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2605758","source_hash":"072b730f746005cb8980508e98c2554cec5678dfe6a380a1884e18bb9627bf27","text":"如果自线路终止之日起未满 21 个月，则"}]}